Create a subagent identity for an independent task. Sync mode waits for the response; async mode returns immediately so the work can be observed with wait_for_subagents. Concurrent sync spawns can run in parallel. Give the task a concise lowercase name that is unique among the current agent's children. The returned identity is its canonical path beneath the current agent.
